    description: "The pyffi linker only creates ffi_bridge edges for CFFI/ctypes calls targeting repo-local C symbols. Calls to C stdlib via ffi.dlopen(None) produce no bridge edges and no IO tags. Scope expansion from INV-kagob."  # 1764
